			<div class="feature-column-carousel__inner swiper-wrapper">
				
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Privacy Display" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:1">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Privacy Display</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">The world’s first <br />Privacy Display on mobile<br /></h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Meet the world's first innovative display technology, the Privacy Display on Galaxy S26 Ultra, which is a new hardware-based privacy protector that shields your onscreen activities just like a privacy screen protector. The display panel has been re-engineered with technology that combines wide pixels and narrow pixels, moving the screen's pixels dynamically and keeping the display for your eyes only.<sup>1</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_privacy_display_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_privacy_display_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="Two Galaxy S26 Ultra phones in Cobalt Violet, seen from the front at an angle. A messaging app notification on one display can be seen clearly because Privacy Display is turned off. The other has Privacy Display turned on and the notification is dark so the content onscreen can&#39;t be seen." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_privacy_display_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_privacy_display_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="Two Galaxy S26 Ultra phones in Cobalt Violet, seen from the front at an angle. A messaging app notification on one display can be seen clearly because Privacy Display is turned off. The other has Privacy Display turned on and the notification is dark so the content onscreen can&#39;t be seen." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="ProScaler" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:2">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">ProScaler</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Naturally clear<br />and colorful displays</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">The displays across our latest Galaxy smartphones now feature a substantial boost in graphical performance. The advanced mobile Digital Natural Image engine (mDNIe) improves image processing precision by 4 times, delivering significantly refined and enhanced image quality with smooth, natural-looking details and gradients. And ProScaler, our AI-powered image processing algorithm, delivers upscaling with image quality that can be enhanced up to QHD+. Enjoy a colorful, clear visual for whatever's on your screen.<sup>2,3,4</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_proscaler_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_proscaler_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="Galaxy S26 Ultra seen from the front with a landscape on the display that continues into the background. The image onscreen is split to show the difference ProScaler makes, as the image with ProScaler is crisp and more detailed. Color is also more enhanced with improved mDNIe technology." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_proscaler_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_proscaler_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="Galaxy S26 Ultra seen from the front with a landscape on the display that continues into the background. The image onscreen is split to show the difference ProScaler makes, as the image with ProScaler is crisp and more detailed. Color is also more enhanced with improved mDNIe technology." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Durability" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:3">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Durability</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Samsung Galaxy's <br />toughest glass ever</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">The Galaxy S26 Series smartphones are reinforced by Corning® display glass to protect your Galaxy. Corning’s specialized material, Corning® Gorilla® Armor 2 simultaneously reduces Galaxy S26 Ultra's surface reflection while also preserving touch — and it's all made possible through a precision layering process.<sup>5</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
