										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/04_durability_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/04_durability_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="Galaxy S26 Ultra in Cobalt Violet is seen from the side to show the additional layer of protection that Corning® Gorilla® Glass provides." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
