									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Customized Processor</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">The most powerful processor,<br />customized for Galaxy</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">The customized Snapdragon® 8 Elite Gen 5 for Galaxy enables a fast experience powering Galaxy S26 Ultra with the most powerful 3 nm processor on a Galaxy smartphone yet. To fit the AI era, improvements to the GPU and NPU speed up agent collaboration, as well as gaming. Galaxy's custom features have also been incorporated, which include ProScaler and mobile Digital Natural Image engine ( mDNIe ) for greater processing efficiency that helps preserve battery life without compromising the view.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
