										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_customized_processor_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_customized_processor_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="A chipset. NPU, GPU, CPU and Customized Image Enhancer." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
