					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Vapor Chamber" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:2">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Vapor Chamber</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Play longer, stay cooler <br />with Vapor Chamber</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Galaxy smartphones come with unique hardware to help keep things cool when you're pushing your limits. Galaxy S26's Vapor Chamber has an increased surface area, while Galaxy S26 Ultra includes a new multi-channel structure — both helping to dissipate heat more effectively. The tailored thermal interface material (TIM) also helps absorb and disperse heat from surrounding components. This ensures fast and responsive action, even as the game heats up.<sup>8</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
