			<div class="feature-column-carousel__inner swiper-wrapper">
				
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Nightography Video" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:1">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Nightography Video</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Illuminate the scene<br />with Nightography</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Powerful cameras on Galaxy enable superior low-light photos and videos with Nightography. And Galaxy S26 Ultra's 200 MP Wide camera now opens to F1.4, which is 47% brighter, and the Telephoto Camera with 10x optical quality zoom has a 37% brighter F2.9 aperture — all making Galaxy S26 Ultra the brightest camera in the Galaxy S Series.<br /><br />The advanced processor also enhances low-light video performance on each camera sensor, and Nightography steps in with optimized noise filtering. Resulting in well-lit videos with improved color and detail that other cameras miss in the dark.<sup>10,11,12,13,14,15</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_nightography_video_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_nightography_video_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="A close up of the main screen on Galaxy S26 Ultra. The Camera app is on the main screen, capturing a video of a woman at dusk. The result has improved color and detail thanks to Nightography." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_nightography_video_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_nightography_video_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="A close up of the main screen on Galaxy S26 Ultra. The Camera app is on the main screen, capturing a video of a woman at dusk. The result has improved color and detail thanks to Nightography." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="200 MP Camera" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:2">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">200 MP Camera</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">200 MP camera <br />for incredible details</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">The cameras on Galaxy impress with their advanced detail and clarity. At the heart of Galaxy S26 Ultra's camera system is the 200 MP Wide camera, enhanced with the advanced ProVisual Engine and a wider F1.4 aperture. This high-resolution sensor can deliver true-to-life hues and in-depth details in each capture, and allows you to crop in close without losing quality. With Galaxy S26 Ultra, your Gallery will be filled with clear, high-quality and detailed photos.<sup>2,10,12,15</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
