										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_200mp_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_200mp_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="A photo of a landscape with hot air balloons flying through the air. A crop of the photo shows the true-to-life color and details." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="100x Space Zoom" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:3">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">100x Space Zoom</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Space Zoom. <br />Zoom further, get closer</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Galaxy smartphones feature powerful zoom, and on Galaxy S26 Ultra, our signature camera feature Space Zoom takes you from 1x to 100x with clarity. The telephoto lenses harness 3x and 5x optical zoom plus 2x, 10x optical quality zoom, all enhanced with AI Zoom. And with a wider aperture on the 10x optical quality zoom camera, photos stay clear while zooming. So when you're at a concert, there's no bad seat. Even from the back of the venue, you can pull the scene in closer and clearer.<sup>2,10,13,15,16,17</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/03_100x_space_zoom_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/03_100x_space_zoom_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="A scene of a concert and a skeleton view of the telephoto camera on Galaxy S26 Ultra showing the technology that allows users to zoom in 100 times and retain clarity and details." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/03_100x_space_zoom_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/03_100x_space_zoom_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="A scene of a concert and a skeleton view of the telephoto camera on Galaxy S26 Ultra showing the technology that allows users to zoom in 100 times and retain clarity and details." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Selfie Camera" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:4">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Selfie Camera</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Selfies, leveled up<br />by ProVisual Engine</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Rediscover the art of the selfie with our unique AI ISP technology on the Galaxy S26 Series' Front camera. In addition to the improved ProVisual Engine, the camera can detect subjects and optimize the result. Now when you take a selfie on Galaxy S26 Series smartphones, the AI Image Signal Processor (ISP) rebuilds the image to ensure it is as natural and accurate as possible, with true-to-life skin tones and realistic facial details.<sup>10,15</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/04_selfie_camera_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/04_selfie_camera_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="A selfie of a woman with natural skin tones and details thanks to the AI Image Signal Processor on Galaxy S26 Ultra." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/04_selfie_camera_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/04_selfie_camera_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="A selfie of a woman with natural skin tones and details thanks to the AI Image Signal Processor on Galaxy S26 Ultra." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Super Steady" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:5">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Super Steady</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Stay Super Steady, <br />even on the move</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">For stability during action shots, the latest Galaxy smartphones offer Super Steady with Horizontal Lock. Stabilization functions on the Galaxy S26 Series have been upgraded with the new Horizontal Lock feature, which calculates the direction of gravity in real time to lock in your shots along a consistent horizontal line, corrected up to 360-degrees. So when you're recording your new puppy, you can get shake-free shots and know the resulting playback will be clear and steady.<sup>2,10,18</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/05_super_steady_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/05_super_steady_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="A person on a BMX bike is doing a trick in mid-air. The Super Steady with Horizontal Lock interface is overlaid, with three icons for keeping the video level, keeping action smooth or turning off the function. The capture is level and steady." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/05_super_steady_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/05_super_steady_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="A person on a BMX bike is doing a trick in mid-air. The Super Steady with Horizontal Lock interface is overlaid, with three icons for keeping the video level, keeping action smooth or turning off the function. The capture is level and steady." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Expert RAW" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:6">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Expert RAW</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Capture like a pro. <br />Expert RAW</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Take pro-level control of the powerful camera on Galaxy S26 Ultra with the Expert RAW app. Shoot with 16-bit RAW image format instead of JPEG for greater editing control and access manual camera functions, including ISO, shutter speed, white balance, exposure and focus — even choosing which camera to use. There are special photo options within the app as well, like the new ocean mode, which optimizes the camera for underwater photos, optimizing the color to deliver true colors and clear images.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/06_expert_raw_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/06_expert_raw_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="Galaxy S26 Ultra in Cobalt Violet, in horizontal position with an underwater scene in the background. The Expert RAW app is on the main screen, taking a photo of the underwater scene. A line shows the difference between the original photo and the optimized photo, which has the blue hue cleaned up to result in only clear and realistic colors." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/06_expert_raw_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/06_expert_raw_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="Galaxy S26 Ultra in Cobalt Violet, in horizontal position with an underwater scene in the background. The Expert RAW app is on the main screen, taking a photo of the underwater scene. A line shows the difference between the original photo and the optimized photo, which has the blue hue cleaned up to result in only clear and realistic colors." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
