			<div class="feature-column-carousel__inner swiper-wrapper">
				
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Battery Usage" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:1">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Battery Usage</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Galaxy's superpower: <br />all-day battery life</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Equipped with high-capacity batteries, the Galaxy lineup is made to give you power that lasts all day. Galaxy S26 Ultra has 5000 mAh, Galaxy S26+ has 4900 mAh and Galaxy S26 has been expanded to 4300 mAh. The battery life is enabled by hardware and software optimization, like the mobile Digital Natural Image engine (mDNIe) technology, which helps reduce the display's current consumption and enhance battery usage time. So not only is the view easy on the eyes, it helps you stay powered up for longer.<sup>22,23,24</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_battery_usage_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_battery_usage_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="The interior hardware of Galaxy S26 Ultra. Pixels of light move between the chipset, which says GPU, NPU and CPU, and the battery to demonstrate how the processor helps enable the all-day battery life." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_battery_usage_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/01_battery_usage_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="The interior hardware of Galaxy S26 Ultra. Pixels of light move between the chipset, which says GPU, NPU and CPU, and the battery to demonstrate how the processor helps enable the all-day battery life." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Super Fast Charging" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:2">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Super Fast Charging</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Power your battery <br />Super Fast</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Reduce downtime with the innovative charging on Galaxy devices. With Super Fast Charging 3.0, Galaxy S26 Ultra can help you recharge your phone up to 75% in around 30 minutes. And with the implementation of new Magnetic Power Profile technology, you can just put your phone down and magnets help ensure an optimal charging position. Spend less time plugged in and more time focusing on your priorities.<sup>25</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_super_fast_charging_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_super_fast_charging_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="A USB-C charging cable plugs into Galaxy S26 Ultra. A charging circle and lightning bolt are overlaid to indicate the super fast charging capabilities." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_super_fast_charging_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/02_super_fast_charging_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="A USB-C charging cable plugs into Galaxy S26 Ultra. A charging circle and lightning bolt are overlaid to indicate the super fast charging capabilities." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
