										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Slimness Design</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Made strong.<br />Designed beautiful</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Through hardware innovation and elegant engineering, Galaxy smartphones are incredibly thin and durable. Galaxy S26 Ultra is our thinnest Ultra yet at 7.9 mm thick, crafted with durable materials. An Armor Aluminum frame surrounds your device, and the addition of Corning® Gorilla® glass to both the front and back ensures scratch-resistant clarity. Finally, the IP68-rated water resistance ensures you can be caught in the rain or splashed poolside and your Galaxy S26 Series phone will be no worse for the wear.<sup>6,26,27,28</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
