			<button an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-arrow-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:arrow:left" type="button" class="swiper-button-prev">
				<span class="hidden">Previous</span>
				<svg class="icon" focusable="false">
					<use xlink:href="#previous-regular" href="#previous-regular"></use>
				</svg>
			</button>
			<div class="feature-column-carousel__inner swiper-wrapper">
				
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Hybrid Driver Architecture" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:1">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Hybrid Driver Architecture</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Independent amps and drivers, tuned per frequency range<br /></h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">To reproduce sound as originally intended, the latest Galaxy Buds is built with a hybrid driver system that uses independent amplification. Each driver is assigned a frequency range suited to its acoustic characteristics, avoiding compromises and preserving rich, full-spectrum sound. The enhanced woofer with expanded diaphragm area makes room for freer resonance, faster response and natural bass, while the tweeter is responsible for exceptionally clear highs. Precise tuning ensures phase coherence and smooth transitions, delivering unified Hi-Fi sound. Rediscover every nuance of your music with the latest Galaxy.<sup>11,32</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_01_2_way_speaker_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_01_2_way_speaker_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="Skeleton view of Galaxy Buds4 Pro in Black. The earbud parts are separated and in the center are the woofer and tweeter." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_01_2_way_speaker_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_01_2_way_speaker_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="Skeleton view of Galaxy Buds4 Pro in Black. The earbud parts are separated and in the center are the woofer and tweeter." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Advanced Wireless Audio" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:2">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Advanced Wireless Audio</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Ultra high quality audio with 24-bit / 96 kHz</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Hi-Fi sound requires high-resolution audio and high sampling rates. Galaxy Buds is equipped with Samsung Seamless Codec (SSC) up to 24-bit / 96 kHz to preserve the original sound with minimal distortion. With SSC, Galaxy Buds dynamically balances bandwidth and stability to maintain optimal listening experience with less audible artifacts or dropouts. Simply turn on the Ultra High Quality Audio (UHQ) option on your Galaxy S or Z Series to hear high-fidelity sound with natural ambience and subtle reverberation — even the intricate spatial details in every recording.<sup>11,33,34</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_02_hi_fi_codec_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_02_hi_fi_codec_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="Galaxy S26 Ultra with the &#39;Advanced quality options&#39; screen open. The &#39;Ultra high quality (UHQ) audio&#39; is on and the &#39;Super wide band speech&#39; is off. Galaxy Buds4 Pro earbuds on each side of the smartphone." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_02_hi_fi_codec_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_02_hi_fi_codec_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="Galaxy S26 Ultra with the &#39;Advanced quality options&#39; screen open. The &#39;Ultra high quality (UHQ) audio&#39; is on and the &#39;Super wide band speech&#39; is off. Galaxy Buds4 Pro earbuds on each side of the smartphone." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
					<div class="feature-column-carousel__item swiper-slide  feature-column-carousel__item--align-center" data-type-headline="Super Clear Call" an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-index-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:index:3">
						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Super Clear Call</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Crystal-clear calls, even in noise</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Hear and be heard with unmatched, stunning clarity even during phone calls. The latest Galaxy Buds and smartphones support Super Clear Call, exchanging great amount of information with Super Wideband (SWB) that is capable of up to 16 kHz, delivering distinct dialog between the caller and receiver. The advanced Deep Neural Network (DNN) sharply distinguishes your voice, even in noisy environments, helping conversations flow smoothly. Make your calls crystal clear like Hi-Fi.<sup>11,35,51</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
								</div>
							</div>
							
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__figure">
								
								
									
									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_03_super_wideband_call_pc.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_03_super_wideband_call_mo.png?$LazyLoad_Home_PNG$" alt="Surrounding Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro are lines to indicate seamless, clear communication between the caller and receiver, with a phone call icon in the middle." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
										<img class="image__main lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_03_super_wideband_call_pc.png?$570_N_PNG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/all_about_galaxy/audio_03_super_wideband_call_mo.png?$720_N_PNG$" alt="Surrounding Galaxy S26 Ultra and Galaxy Buds4 Pro are lines to indicate seamless, clear communication between the caller and receiver, with a phone call icon in the middle." data-aem-asset-id=""/>
									</div>
								
								
								
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				 
				
			</div>
			<button an-tr="ft12_feature column carousel-product family showcase-arrow-indication" an-ca="indication" an-ac="carousel" an-la="carousel:arrow:right" type="button" class="swiper-button-next">
				<span class="hidden">Next</span>
